# Constructive living-law adapter facade

Exports the axiom-free authority core together with the explicit Mathlib
atom-field restriction, number-system closure, real temporal-action adapter,
root-generated polarized determinant-line readout, finite-generator cofinal
relation compression and information-memory readout layer.  Noetherian
stabilization and the PID submodule theorem internally generate the
compression's strictly perfect two-term replacement and determinant unit
torsor.  The rooted pro-history settlement classifier additionally exposes
the conditional compact/perfect branch or its persistent presentation
residual, with an explicit finite residual coordinate on the latter branch.
Its source-installed history face is admitted through the existing projection
installation and retains the exact whole-ledger write-back and generated next.
The faithful evaluator face then classifies the actual map and exposes an
explicit relation/kernel/coverage residual coordinate before any quotient
equivalence is read.
The source-installed cochain face then binds the same actual occurrence to
its cofinal presented complex, exposes differential naturality and `d² = 0`,
and keeps closure/law/relation/derived-residual dispositions total.
Its derived-residual branch now exposes a canonical nonzero categorical
coordinate, while leaving determinant eligibility conditional on a generated
bounded-dualizable face.
The source-complete history disposition now generates that bounded branch's
perfect/determinant/unit readout or the explicit presentation residual.
The common-occurrence face binds the history determinant, faithful mapping
residual, and cochain relation readout before any comparison is attempted.
The dual-evaluation face then derives a two-sided dualizable branch or an
explicit kernel/cokernel residual from a source-owned pairing on that same
complete carrier; it accepts no nondegeneracy or finite-determinant premise.
The perfect-ambient junction grants determinant eligibility only when that
duality evidence and the generated bounded history branch coexist; otherwise
it preserves the history or duality residual.
The source-generated coimage producer is additionally installed as a
dependent face of the admitted cofinal history/cochain/duality step, retaining
the same root, whole-ledger write-back, and generated next rather than creating
a second source adapter.
The cofinal kernel-quotient tower and inverse limit are now coefficient-neutral:
every `CommRing R` keeps its actual linear evaluators, root projection,
source-morphism functoriality and exact-envelope readback.  Any observation of
that envelope retains kernel and coverage loss independently.  The countable
free rational counterexample simultaneously prevents this relative exact pair
from being mislabeled as a uniform ordinary algebraic reflexive ambient.
Exact observations now additionally generate finite-projective tensor duality,
reflexivity and perfect evaluation or an explicit boundedness/observation
residual.  Determinant frames and units remain downstream of a genuine
Picard-trivialized line face.
Exterior powers now commute with localization for all projective carriers;
constant stalk rank therefore generates an invertible top exterior line and
an actual Picard coordinate.  The complete finite-projective disposition
returns either its trivial/nontrivial Picard branch or two actual primes with
unequal ranks.  A global frame is never selected, and rank variation is kept
as an explicit representation coordinate rather than mislabeled as failure
of the source carrier.
Linear equivalences now transport the complete stalk-rank profile, exterior
line, Picard coordinate and either dependent residual with strict identity
and composition laws.  Arbitrary linear source morphisms first generate a
bijective-equivalence branch or actual kernel/coverage coordinates, so a
non-equivalence cannot manufacture Picard naturality.  An occurrence-indexed
source material law now installs the complete scalar cofinal determinant
disposition as a dependent face of the existing cofinal-history controller
step; the generated step accepts no free scalar data and retains its exact
occurrence, whole-ledger write-back and generated next current.
When an existing exact-envelope carrier also exposes an actual complex
feature map, the feature face now quotients its Gram radical, embeds the
quotient faithfully and densely into the completion of the feature range,
and generates positive Gram/energy readouts with strict source-morphism
naturality.  The feature is source material, not a generic conclusion:
a scaling countermodel proves that faithful algebraic duality alone cannot
select a nondegenerate Hermitian polarization natural under every linear
equivalence.
An actual test functional now receives a second total disposition relative
to its source-owned Hilbert feature: restriction of the continuous Hilbert
dual either generates a bounded extension and canonical Riesz readback, or
the quotient by that restriction range retains an explicit generalized-dual
coordinate.  The equivariant version restricts to bounded eigenfunctionals;
isometric actions force unit character norm on the positive branch, while a
nonunit character with nonzero source readback generates a nonzero residual.
These residuals transport contravariantly along commuting source/Hilbert
squares and do not manufacture the source functional or its spectral law.
An actual linear source map into a complete Hilbert carrier now also generates
the closure of its range, the quotient by that closed range, and the canonical
orthogonal residual.  Quotient norm and residual energy agree; a one-sided
isometric square gives only forward quotient/compression transport, while an
invertible source/target square generates isometric quotient action and exact
residual-energy invariance.  Closed range, density, finite dimension and an
eigenvector are never premises.
The source functional can instead join its feature as the second coordinate
of one canonical graph map.  Completion of the actual graph range then
generates a Hilbert ambient, the unique continuous graph coordinate, and a
total action disposition: a source-generated isometric face when every
explicit graph-norm residual vanishes, or the whole nonempty fibre of
residual source coordinates otherwise.  This repairs the chosen observation
language without asserting that the earlier Hilbert feature was already
adequate, and assumes neither finiteness nor determinant eligibility.
Actual source/feature/functional commuting squares generate target, range and
completion maps; the completed coordinate is natural and the induced maps
obey strict identity and composition laws without injectivity, surjectivity
or isometry hypotheses.
When an actual relation family is annihilated by that same source functional,
the graph completion now quotients the closure of the relation range and
generates the unique continuous descended coordinate.  A nonzero source
coordinate remains nonzero; the source map stays dense; the quotient is a
complete Hilbert carrier with canonical conjugate-linear Riesz self-duality.
Relation-compatible source morphisms descend naturally, including strict
identity/composition and noninjective collapsing maps.  No finite,
projective, nondegenerate, closed-range, or determinant premise enters this
functional graph-cokernel perfectification.
Positive real scales now also carry one canonical complex-power character;
its prime and square-root evaluations are literal dependent faces, every
value is a unit, and no prime-independent scalar can replace this
multiplicative source coordinate.
An actual faithful integral face now receives complete action and prime
dispositions: the ambient action either descends uniquely or exposes an
escape coordinate, while multiplication by `p` is either an equivalence or
leaves a nonzero `L / pL` residual.  Full complex carriers are correctly
classified as localized.  The generated prime-power quotients
`L / p^(n+1)L` form a natural inverse-limit completion; its kernel coimage is
faithful and universal, while failure of separation retains an explicit
infinitely divisible coordinate.  Character orbits similarly expose unit
norm or a concrete nonzero null sequence, without assuming discreteness.
Every source group and complex character now also generate the integral
group ring `ℤ[G]`: its canonical basis carries invertible left/right source
translations, character evaluation and orbit realization are covariant, and
`δ₁ mod p` is nonzero for every rational prime.  Compatible evaluator towers
map canonically into prime-power completion or expose the exact stage-kernel
residual; no finite determinant or domain endpoint supplies this structure.
The same integral basis now generates its faithful Kronecker evaluation;
translation is contragredient to inverse translation and therefore acts on
the canonical exact-perfect pair without an automorphism premise.  Any actual
Hilbert measurement is then settled totally: failure to descend exposes one
source coordinate, while a descended measurement receives the existing
strict/phase-only/radial covariance disposition.  Perfectification never
manufactures the missing action--measurement square, and every residual is
natural under the same source/Hilbert morphism.
The construction is now source-dependent over the complete occurrence tree:
each payload generates its own joint state and four-way disposition, the full
tree projects back to the unchanged parent, and every lawful readout factors
through the existing unique fold.  Root authority is a separate admission:
the complete raw measurement/action family must already be installed in the
fixed projection inventory.  Only then does a private controller step inherit
the existing cofinal-duality ledger write-back and generated next; the adapter
cannot widen the root or accept a covariance equation as input.
The previously parallel integral action, coherent evolution and detector
action/readout now also generate one minimal forward-orbit carrier.  A single
endomorphism acts there, all three faces commute definitionally, and failure
of the original event graph to be invariant remains one incidence residual
whose coherent and detector projections are exactly the old mismatches.  No
commuting square or residual-zero verdict is accepted by this constructor.
Compatible source maps induce the carrier map and preserve seed, action,
faces and residual; identity and composition are strict, without an
injectivity or surjectivity premise.
The detector maps can now be installed as a literal extension of the existing
root-law joint-state inventory.  Its private temporal step maps the same
complete pairing occurrence to the canonical input and actual `Omega`
occurrences, proves fixed-root factorization, and reuses the existing whole
ledger and generated next; no square, zero verdict or branch is caller data.
Across an actual compiler successor, the same free generator history now
either generates the unique identity-on-generators completion map or an exact
generator/relation residual.  The mapped branch then totally settles pairing
kernel/value, source action, measurement and Hilbert evolution naturality;
outer representation residuals transport only on the fully generated branch.
Terminal versus successor remains a compiler output, never a caller branch.
The complete source and target pairing inventories now align by canonical
accounted-tree zip or retain an exact shape residual.  The aligned tree folds,
uniquely, to a passive all-generated carry or its first trace-certified joint
residual.  This carry reuses the installed raw face, compiler successor,
whole ledger and next without inventing active-effect change or debit.
Legacy recursive-effect next therefore remains reserved for actual dynamic
progress; an empty fixed obstruction vocabulary cannot absorb a passive
residual by relabelling.
The exact negative image now carries a low-universe token indexed by its full
rooted residual.  That token freely generates a same-support world coface,
faithful obstruction and causal row, a narrower operational theory failure,
and an extension of every existing U7 calculus whose new branch is the exact
theory audit.  A generated audit ledger root now installs exactly that row in
a size-one finite patch while every inherited row stays in the identity
remainder; its target chart reads back to the original compiler successor.
The proof-relevant whole-entry restructuring law now removes every
`Subsingleton OpenAt` premise.  The fixed audit authority installs the
transported theory, extended-U7 failure projection, complete event inventory
and terminal handoff; the selected row generates causal authority,
root/U7 commuting, rooted failure and the existing minimal coface.  Domain
coordinate equations remain downstream dependent-face realizations.  This
constructor is conditional on an existing old U7/calculus.  The causal audit
transition now consumes the canonical controller-selected passive residual
and the exact source temporal event, stores both the source occurrence and
its compiler-generated target occurrence in the concrete audit event, keeps
all inherited rows in the identity remainder, and lets only the residual row
generate U7 authority and the existing minimal coface.  Empty old obstruction
languages generate their U7 epoch canonically.  Revised material and its
first write remain downstream source responsibilities rather than fields of
this transition.
When adjacent evaluator stages differ by source-generated additive
equivalences, cumulative inverse source transport canonically normalizes the
tower to that fixed-source interface and conjugates its quotient transitions.
Noninvertible source transitions remain explicit residuals rather than being
silently divided away.
For a source-owned endomorphism and first derivative, the square-zero layer
now generates the constant/infinitesimal pair operator, its fixed-kernel to
fixed-cokernel connecting map, and the exact first-variation Bockstein
readout.  The actual dual-number scalar extension is canonically equivalent
to two copies of the ordinary extension; this chart conjugates
`1 - (1 + aε)F` to the pair operator and is natural for source-module maps.
No finiteness, perfection or determinant premise enters this first-order
layer.
An actual source map and an injective dependent cochain face now also generate
the face's categorical cokernel complex and the source residual chain map.
Its components are canonically the existing range quotients; residual zero is
equivalent to the unique chain factorization, and strict subface squares
transport the construction through strict, homotopy, and derived source
coherence without upgrading a derived equality to a strict one.
This file
defines no source, registry, authority or outcome.  Field/quotient
dependencies remain presentation readouts and never enter the root compiler.
